# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Tauri bundle resources — the @synapseia-network/node CLI ships as a
# single opaque tarball at src-tauri/resources/cli-bundle.tar.gz that is
# materialized at build time by CI (release.yml) or `pnpm bundle:cli`
# locally. A committed placeholder (empty .tar.gz) keeps the Tauri
# resource path resolvable at compile time; the real bundle is regenerated
# per build. We do NOT track the loose `cli/` directory anymore — it
# exists only transiently between bundle steps and is removed after the
# tarball is produced.
!src-tauri/resources/
!src-tauri/resources/cli-bundle.tar.gz
src-tauri/resources/cli/

